1
00:00:15,288 --> 00:00:17,900
Tu attends un colis ?
Are you waiting for a parcel?

2
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,620
Oui, puis je vais au supermarché.
Yes, then I’m going to the supermarket.

3
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:25,940
Je dois retirer de l’argent au distributeur.
I have to withdraw some money at the ATM.

4
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:30,380
Moi, je passe à la laverie et au pressing.
I’m stopping by the laundromat and the dry cleaner’s.

5
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:34,796
Ensuite, je vais au garage pour ma voiture.
Then I’m going to the garage for my car.

6
00:00:34,896 --> 00:00:39,236
Je vais chez le coiffeur, puis à la mairie.
I’m going to the hairdresser’s, then to the town hall.

7
00:00:39,336 --> 00:00:43,940
D’accord. On se retrouve après ?
Okay. Shall we meet up afterward?

8
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:47,588
Oui, j’attends ton message !
Yes, I’ll wait for your message!
